    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d143-a4">

                <pb facs="0351" n="217" sameAs="frus:frus1888p1/pg217"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4 in No. 445.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract of a letter from Elizabeth C. Ward to A.
                        L. Freeman, esq.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Salem</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-04-18"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 18,
                        1864</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have not sent a power of attorney to any one, though requested to do so, having
                    full confidence in your ability, and hope that you will continue to act for me
                    until the estate is settled.</p>
                <p>True copy.</p>
                <closer><signed>
                        <list>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">George F.
                                    Seward</hi>.</item>
                            <item><hi rendition="#small-caps">Albert L.
                                    Freeman.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1864-09-08"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 8,
                        1864</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
